Z||000003||grinthock||11-29-2001||12:21 AM||||Princess Auto - 6 bucks includes the socket.<P>Or most car audio shops.. if you are spending MORE than $10 per relay you are getting ripped.<P>You ENTIRE locking system only requires 2 relays.  Why are you saying 6????!<P>Also these are automotive, high durability relays not some PCB relay which are Yes, about 1.50.  Expect to pay $10 or LESS for them but at least 5.  Again, you only need 2.<p>[This message has been edited by grinthock (edited 11-29-2001).]||||reg||1
